      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h1><span><span>National Printing Research</span></span></h1>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><span>ASF is conducting a nationwide printing study and would like to inform sustainable schools about our research as well as <span><a href=\"https://forms.gle/whiC4YaFj81Cfdvn6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">extend an invitation to participate</a></span> by providing printing records. ASF believes data from a sustainable school like yours can offer critical insights into optimizing paper usage and would be immensely grateful for contributions.&nbsp;</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/136NgMTf1FHjSw6nk_OugzNm9RdHOxhG02yNTiT1Rkbc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span><span><span>Official Research Letter</span></span></span></a></p>"
